{"id":"5f0d45b79409d64f","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-computable-function.md","title":"Numerical Machine Computability","display":"df-computable-function — Numerical Machine Computability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-computable-function","aliases":["90-df-computable-function"],"display":"df-computable-function — Numerical Machine Computability","depends_on":["[[90-df-encoding]]","[[90-df-tm-output]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-computable-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-computable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-function — Numerical Machine Computability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8f303a307372354c\" href=\"?note=8f303a307372354c\" title=\"90-df-encoding\">90-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"700b210d964b7299\" href=\"?note=700b210d964b7299\" title=\"90-df-tm-output\">90-df-tm-output</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(f\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Partial}\">\\(\\operatorname{Partial}\\)</span> 取本书原部分函数定义。数值元组输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x)\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x)\\)</span>，数值输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle)\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halts}_M,\\operatorname{Output}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Halts}_M,\\operatorname{Output}_M\\)</span> 采用本地双向纸带运行。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k\\)</span> 保留既有调用名，不是原复合算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span>；非合法数值输入上的机器行为不受此谓词约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{Partial}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\ \\Bigl[\n\\{0,1\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma_M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\\n[\\operatorname{Halts}_M(\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x))\\Longleftrightarrow\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall(\\vec x,y)\\in f\\\n[\\operatorname{Output}_M(\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x))=\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle)]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{Partial}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\ \\Bigl[\n\\{0,1\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma_M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\\n[\\operatorname{Halts}_M(\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x))\\Longleftrightarrow\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall(\\vec x,y)\\in f\\\n[\\operatorname{Output}_M(\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x))=\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle)]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 零元部分函数以单个空元组为可能输入；值为空或唯一自然数都可计算。该接口只给出机器可计算性，不循环引用本书 Kleene T 谓词或可接受编号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"8f303a307372354c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-tm-output","status":"resolved","id":"700b210d964b7299","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-tm-output]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Partial}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Halts}_M,\\operatorname{Output}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&\n\\operatorname{Partial}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\ \\Bigl[\n\\{0,1\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma_M\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\\n[\\operatorname{Halts}_M(\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x))\\Longleftrightarrow\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall(\\vec x,y)\\in f\\\n[\\operatorname{Output}_M(\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x))=\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle)]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1732,"backlinks":[{"id":"8105afc544202519","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f)$ 表示 [[90-df-computable-function]] 中以 $\\operatorname{wordenc}$ 输入输出的机器可计算部分函数谓词，不是本书复合算子 $\\operatorname{Comp}$。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-computable-function]]"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"| `wordenc`、`worddec` | 带元数前缀的数值元组词编码及像集上的部分逆；空元组的词码是单个位0。 | [[90-df-encoding]] |\n| `AcceptNum`、`EffNum`、`s_{m,n}` | 有效通用求值、覆盖及全递归翻译；s-m-n保留程序索引在先的顺序。 | [[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]、[[90-thm-smn]] |\n| `Halts_M`、`Output_M`、`Comp_k^{88}` | 本地通用双向纸带的停机、词输出及数值可计算性；不等同于半无限纸带历史码。 | [[90-df-tm-halts]]、[[90-df-tm-output]]、[[90-df-computable-function]] |\n| 子语言呈示的 `EssUnd_{S,g}(P)` | 对P自身语言中的Ax视图作句子集嵌入，不改P三元组及当前S,g。 | [[90-df-essentially-undecidable]] |"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-one-reducible.md]]\n[[90-df-omega.md]]\n[[90-df-provable.md]]\n[[90-df-relation.md]]\n[[90-df-satisfaction.md]]\n[[90-df-structure.md]]\n[[90-df-substitution.md]]\n[[90-df-term.md]]\n[[90-df-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-halts.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-output.md]]\n[[90-df-turing-machine.md]]\n[[90-df-variable.md]]\n[[90-thm-smn.md]]"}],"outgoing":["8f303a307372354c","700b210d964b7299","e860bc8bff2a4e39"]}